OL,3,GNEWSANew mayor role needs public
OL,4,Aconsultation says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe MP for Guildford said she is
OL,7,Fconcerned at the lack of public
OL,8,Fconsultation over the possible
OL,9,Fintroduction of an elected mayor in
OL,10,FSurrey.
OL,12,FLiberal Democrat Zoe Franklin told the
OL,13,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,14,F(LDRS) that any devolution deal must
OL,15,Fprovide "real benefits" for the county.
OL,17,FThe government revealed in October's
OL,18,FBudget that several new mayoral
OL,19,Fcombined authorities are on the cusp of
OL,20,Fcreation, including Surrey, with a new
OL,21,Fmayor working alongside the incoming
OL,22,FEast and West Surrey councils.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
