OL,3,GNEWSANew mayor role needs public
OL,4,Aconsultation says MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government described the plans as
OL,7,Fpart of its programme to "give
OL,8,Fcommunities greater control over the
OL,9,Fdecisions that shape jobs, transport,
OL,10,Fhousing and public services in their
OL,11,Farea."
